  <body>
    <header class="top-bar"><nav class="shell nav"><a class="brand-lockup" href="#top" aria-label="essenly home"><svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 16.5C7.3 8.8 12.2 17.2 21 5.5"/><path d="M3 20C8.1 11.6 13.6 18.8 21 9"/><path d="M3.5 12.5C7.8 6.2 12 13.2 20.5 3.5"/><circle cx="15.4" cy="8.6" r="1.55"/></svg><span class="brand">essenly</span></a><div class="nav-right"><span>Trade partners</span><a href="#inquiry">Wholesale inquiry</a></div></nav></header>
    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow intro">Premium Korean hair care for care shops</p><h1 class="intro">A finishing ritual your clients can take home.</h1><p class="hero-copy intro">Essenly RenewShell™ is a premium rinse-out hair mask for salons, hair-care studios and beauty shops that want to pair a memorable in-service moment with a considered retail recommendation.</p><div class="intro"><a class="button" href="#inquiry">Request wholesale information</a><a class="scroll-cue" href="#product"><i></i>Scroll to explore</a></div></div><dl class="hero-facts intro"><div><dt>Product</dt><dd>RenewShell™ Hair Mask</dd></div><div><dt>Made for</dt><dd>Dry, frizzy &amp; colour-treated hair</dd></div><div><dt>Retail presence</dt><dd>Available on Amazon U.S.</dd></div></dl></div></section>
      <section class="product-stage" id="product" aria-label="Essenly RenewShell Hair Mask"><div class="product-scene"><img src="/images/essenly/essenly-product-detail-bg-studio.png" alt="Essenly RenewShell Intense Hydrating Hair Mask in a warm neutral setting"><article class="product-panel"><p class="eyebrow">The product</p><h2>RenewShell™ Intense Hydrating Hair Mask</h2><p>A rich, sensorial conditioning treatment applied to damp hair, left for 5–7 minutes and rinsed clean. It introduces a complete at-home ritual without feeling heavy after use.</p><div class="specs"><div class="spec"><span>Format</span><strong>190ml rinse-out treatment</strong></div><div class="spec"><span>Origin</span><strong>Made in Korea</strong></div><div class="spec"><span>Fragrance</span><strong>Amber Vanilla</strong></div><div class="spec"><span>Retail MSRP</span><strong>$39.00 per unit</strong></div></div></article></div></section>
      <section class="formula section"><div class="shell formula-layout"><div class="formula-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Formula at a glance</p><h2>What makes the ritual feel considered.</h2><p>A buyer-facing product story, clear enough to assess client fit without becoming a consumer detail page.</p><p class="formula-status" aria-live="polite">01 / Keratin</p></div><div class="formula-beats">
        <article class="formula-beat is-active" data-formula="01 / Keratin"><span class="formula-number">01</span><figure class="ingredient-art" aria-label="Keratin fibre system icon"><svg data-ingredient-icon="keratin" viewBox="0 0 220 160" role="img" fill="none" stroke="#27201b" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M24 111C49 68 75 67 102 83c24 15 36-4 52-28 14-21 27-29 43-34"/><path d="M27 127c28-41 55-42 82-26 23 14 36-4 52-27 14-20 27-28 43-33"/><path d="M32 143c30-39 58-40 85-24 22 13 35-4 51-26 14-19 26-27 42-32"/></svg></figure><div class="ingredient-copy"><h3>Keratin</h3><p>A key ingredient called out in the product story for a smoother-feeling hair finish.</p></div></article>
        <article class="formula-beat" data-formula="02 / Collagen"><span class="formula-number">02</span><figure class="ingredient-art" aria-label="Collagen structure system icon"><svg data-ingredient-icon="collagen" viewBox="0 0 220 160" role="img" fill="none" stroke="#27201b" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="86" cy="55" r="37"/><circle cx="134" cy="55" r="37"/><circle cx="86" cy="103" r="37"/><circle cx="134" cy="103" r="37"/></svg></figure><div class="ingredient-copy"><h3>Collagen</h3><p>Part of the conditioning formula behind the mask’s rich application experience.</p></div></article>
        <article class="formula-beat" data-formula="03 / Shea Butter"><span class="formula-number">03</span><figure class="ingredient-art" aria-label="Shea botanical system icon"><svg data-ingredient-icon="shea-butter" viewBox="0 0 220 160" role="img" fill="none" stroke="#27201b" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M111 142V78"/><path d="M111 93C73 74 65 40 111 17c46 23 38 57 0 76Z"/><path d="M111 93V43"/><path d="M111 116c-23-19-46-10-52 13 24 15 45 5 52-13Z"/><path d="M111 116c23-19 46-10 52 13-24 15-45 5-52-13Z"/></svg></figure><div class="ingredient-copy"><h3>Shea Butter</h3><p>Supports the nourishing character expected of a premium, rinse-out hair ritual.</p></div></article>
